Description: Lenovo battery conservation and charging threshold manager
 Lenovo Conservation manages battery charging limits on Lenovo IdeaPad,
 ThinkPad, Legion, LOQ, and IdeaPad Gaming laptops under Linux.
 It supports native hardware limits (60% and 80%) as well as a
 Smart 80% background hysteresis controller.
